  "editorial": {
    "name": "Teradata Covalent",
    "descriptionZh": "Teradata 开源的 Angular Material 组件平台，导航分成 DOCS、COMPONENTS、ECHARTS、UTILITIES 四块。把 ECharts 包成 Angular 组件是它跟普通组件库的区别。",
    "takeawayZh": "给 Angular 项目接上 ECharts 图表与组件",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边是 Covalent 与 Enterprise UI Platform 两行标题，配一句 Reusable tested tools to build robust Angular Material & Angular applications，下面跟 GET STARTED 按钮和一个 2224 Github Stars 的计数；右边是橙色的六边形积木图标。再往下一排三张卡片，分别是 Components（Reusable, atomic and enterprise focused）、Charts（The extensive power of ECharts brought to Angular）、Utilities（Reduce boilerplate with custom pipes, css, animations and more）。页脚还留着 GITTER CHAT 与 FEATURE REQUEST 两个旧入口，落款 ©2016 - 2026 Teradata。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "unknown",
    "pricingNote": null
